{"s":[[null,1,[["q",["I wanna be just like my big brother when I grow up!"],["Vincent"]],["p",["Vincent is a ",["l","居民","villager"]," who lives in the southern part of ",["l","鹈鹕镇","Pelican Town"],". He's a young boy, and can often be found with his best friend ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],". He looks up to his brother ",["l","山姆","Sam"]," and wants to be just like him when he grows up."]]]],["Schedule",2,[["p",["On Tuesday, Wednesday and Friday, Vincent and ",["l","贾斯","Jas"]," spend the afternoon with ",["l","潘妮","Penny"]," being tutored at the ",["l","博物馆","museum"],". During ",["l","夏季","Summer"],", Vincent is often at ",["l","沙滩","the beach"],"."]],["p",["Vincent won't leave ",["l","柳巷1号","his home"]," on rainy days, unless it's Spring 11, when he visits ",["l","哈维的诊所","Harvey's Clinic"],"."]],["p",["After the ",["l","姜岛","Beach Resort"]," on Ginger Island is unlocked, Vincent may randomly spend the day there. After leaving the Island at 6pm, Vincent will immediately go home to bed. Vincent never visits the Resort on Tuesdays, Wednesdays, Fridays, ",["l","节日","Festival"]," days or his checkup day at ",["l","哈维的诊所","Harvey's Clinic"],". Vincent also never visits the Resort without an adult accompanying him."]],["p",["Shown below are Vincent's schedules prioritized highest to lowest. For example, if it is raining, that schedule overrides all others below it."]],["t",[[{"c":2,"h":1,"v":["Green Rain (Year 1)"]}],[["All day"],["In the living room."]]]],["t",[[{"c":2,"h":1,"v":["Tuesday the 9th and Tuesday the 23rd"]}],[["9:00 AM"],["Wakes up for the day."]],[["11:00 AM"],["Plays inside ",["l","柳巷1号","his home"],"."]],[["2:00 PM"],["Leaves ",["l","柳巷1号","his home"]," and heads outside to the ",["l","鹈鹕镇","town square"],"."]],[["5:00 PM"],["Leaves ",["l","鹈鹕镇","town"]," and walks ",["l","柳巷1号","home"],"."]],[["7:00 PM"],["Plays inside ",["l","柳巷1号","his home"],"."]],[["10:00 PM"],["Goes to bed for the night."]]]],["t",[[{"c":2,"h":1,"v":["Spring 11"]}],[["9:00 AM"],["Wakes up,